#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/0-index.md:8
#: 20678e2a5a09496e88c35f6bcf76f61d
msgid ""
"FiveAges **humanoid** descriptions (W1, W2, W2R, S2, S2R, WCE3) are "
"**wheeled-arm humanoids** (mobile base + arms). They are **not** bipedal "
"or footed humanoids."
msgstr ""
"FiveAges 的 **humanoid / 人形** 描述（W1、W2、W2R、S2、S2R、WCE3）是 **轮臂人形**（移动底盘 + "
"臂），**不是** 双足或足式人形。"

